492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186178563}] :question/id #uuid "a418f53c-4747-5aa3-a0ab-fd1903e20600" :question/math-academy-id "q-353607" :question/problem "In a laboratory, a sample is found with $70 \\mathrm{\\% }$ of its original tritium content. Given that the half-life of tritium is $12.3$ years, how old is the sample? Round your answer to **one decimal place**.The sample is approximately\n{{field-1}}\nyears old.\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question." :question/requires-calculator true}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186184057 :question/id #uuid "e4a94ca8-82ee-5776-a46d-b735d4ab60fb" :question/math-academy-id "e-371" :question/problem "Find the integral of $x^2 + 1.$" :question/worked-solution "Applying the sum rule, we compute the sum of the integrals of each function:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {x}^{2}+1\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x+\\int 1\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int {x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x+\\int {x}^{0}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\left(\\frac{{x}^{2+1}}{2+1}\\right)+x+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{3}+x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186184058 :question/id #uuid "ea7dadee-2b44-5e62-bef4-26fb0cb185ea" :question/math-academy-id "e-372" :question/problem "Calculate $$\n\\displaystyle \\int 2 x^3 - x \\,\\textrm d x.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the sum and constant factor rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 2{x}^{3}-x\\,\\text{d}x & =2\\int {x}^{3}\\,\\text{d}x-\\int x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2\\left(\\frac{{x}^{3+1}}{3+1}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{{x}^{1+1}}{1+1}\\right)+C \\\\  & =2\\left(\\frac{{x}^{4}}{4}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}\\right)+C \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{4}}{2}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186184059 :question/id #uuid "8f99b603-2fba-5a58-9966-b91d3a8a773e" :question/math-academy-id "e-373" :question/problem "Calculate $$\n\\displaystyle \\int \\left( 5(\\sqrt{x})^{3} - 4 x^2 + 5\\right) \\,\\textrm d x.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the sum and constant factor rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (5(\\sqrt{x})^{3}-4{x}^{2}+5)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (5{x}^{3/2}-4{x}^{2}+5)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =5\\int {x}^{3/2}\\,\\text{d}x-4\\int {x}^{2}\\text{d}x+5\\int 1\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =5\\left(\\frac{{x}^{5/2}}{\\frac{5}{2}}\\right)-4\\left(\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}\\right)+5(x)+C \\\\  & =5\\cdot \\frac{2}{5}{x}^{5/2}-\\frac{4}{3}{x}^{3}+5x+C \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{{x}^{5}}-\\frac{4}{3}{x}^{3}+5x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186184548 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8121efaa-aeec-5e91-a61d-727d740bc028" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6x^{4} + \\frac{5x^{4}}{2} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186181457} {:answer/id #uuid "92aab1b4-6f6e-5fab-a6a9-b59142f9faf4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3x^{4} + \\frac{5x^{3}}{2} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186181458} {:answer/id #uuid "f24f92fe-e32b-5c6c-8d02-97902921dc09" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12x^{2} + \\frac{5x^{2}}{2} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186181459} {:answer/id #uuid "44324091-9605-52af-a6eb-fd647cfc8423" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3x^{4} + \\frac{5x^{2}}{2} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186181460} {:answer/id #uuid "6e593588-5dad-5897-b45b-4a265b859e18" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3x^{2} + \\frac{5x^{2}}{2} + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186181461}] :answer-field/id #uuid "1e75f571-9fd3-5cf0-aa66-0c64c41a711c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186181456}] :question/id #uuid "a6758c57-4a70-5cd7-8c06-6fcee40efe7d" :question/math-academy-id "q-211" :question/problem "What is $$\n\\displaystyle \\int12x^{3} + 5xdx\n$$?"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186184549 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "874a75be-05b5-5213-a317-ac84d079a6f8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{x^{3}}}{3} - 3x + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186181463} {:answer/id #uuid "b4254b4e-b369-5812-943b-4e67411913f0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt[3]{x^{2}}}{2} - 3x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186181464} {:answer/id #uuid "b8145e65-a4e6-55ed-84fd-bcbca085060c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3x\\sqrt{x^{3}}}{2} - 3x + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186181465} {:answer/id #uuid "1f4f8890-7502-5e8c-90d6-f4aba9048241" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2x\\sqrt[3]{x}}{3} + 3 + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186181466} {:answer/id #uuid "461e199a-4bf9-5631-92ee-54bbc39d5458" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2\\sqrt{x^{3}}}{3} - 3x + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186181467}] :answer-field/id #uuid "14660fe1-ec5a-5be7-8fe4-11781606df39" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186181462}] :question/id #uuid "ebf755a0-1ba0-54d7-8cfa-097d44473af4" :question/math-academy-id "q-2159" :question/problem "What is $$\n\\displaystyle \\int\\sqrt{x} - 3dx\n$$?"}]}
